VALUES ('93000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000f004', 1, 'https://clearpeakexteriors.example/', 12, 1, NULL, '{"queue":["https://clearpeakexteriors.example/spring-specials-2025"],"pages":[{"url":"https://clearpeakexteriors.example/","status":200,"title":"Clearpeak Exteriors | Denver Roof Replacement & Repair","description":"Denver roofing contractor for roof replacement, storm and hail damage repair, and gutters. Free inspections across the Denver metro.","text":"Home roof replacement roof repair storm damage hail damage denver gutters financing about reviews contact free inspection service areas(303) 555-0142Denver roofing, done right the first timeClearpeak Exteriors has replaced and repaired roofs across the Denver metro since 2009. Our crews handle roof replacement and repair for homes in Denver, Aurora, Lakewood, Littleton and Centennial, with a written estimate after a free on-site inspection. Every project gets a dedicated project lead, photo documentation of the roof deck, and a clean-up crew on the last day.We work with all major shingle lines, standing-seam metal and low-slope systems, and we can document storm damage for your insurance adjuster. Call (303) 555-0142 or request an inspection online and we will confirm a time within one business day.Colorado weather is hard on roofs: hail, freeze-thaw cycles and strong UV all shorten shingle life. Our roof replacement and repair service starts with a 21-point inspection, then a clear, itemized proposal with options so you can choose what fits your home and budget.Book a free inspectionClearpeak Exteriors · Denver, CO 80202 · (303) 555-0142","h1":["Denver roofing, done right the first time"],"links":["https://clearpeakexteriors.example/","https://clearpeakexteriors.example/roof-replacement","https://clearpeakexteriors.example/roof-repair","https://clearpeakexteriors.example/storm-damage","https://clearpeakexteriors.example/hail-damage-denver","https://clearpeakexteriors.example/gutters","https://clearpeakexteriors.